{"text":"The future of all our countries is in the hands of you young people. People like you, he said, brimming with talent and energy and hope, who can claim the future that so many in previous generations never realized. All tensions being subdued in Africa today, a realizable future can be reclaimed by solid attendance of accountability. At the beginning of this year, 17 elections were scheduled across our continent. In 1989, there were three democracies in Sub-Saharan Africa. By 2008, there were 23. That to me is progress.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.66},{"text":"future","start":0.66,"end":1.04},{"text":"of","start":1.04,"end":1.4},{"text":"all","start":1.4,"end":2.1},{"text":"our","start":2.1,"end":2.62},{"text":"countries","start":2.62,"end":3.06},{"text":"is","start":3.06,"end":3.3},{"text":"in","start":3.3,"end":3.46},{"text":"the","start":3.46,"end":3.56},{"text":"hands","start":3.56,"end":4.04},{"text":"of","start":4.04,"end":4.3},{"text":"you","start":4.3,"end":4.52},{"text":"young","start":4.52,"end":4.74},{"text":"people","start":4.74,"end":5.28,"punct":"."},{"text":"People","start":6.06,"end":6.46},{"text":"like","start":6.46,"end":6.66},{"text":"you","start":6.66,"end":7.1,"punct":","},{"text":"he","start":7.26,"end":7.34},{"text":"said","start":7.34,"end":7.66,"punct":","},{"text":"brimming","start":8.7,"end":8.94},{"text":"with","start":8.94,"end":9.22},{"text":"talent","start":9.22,"end":9.62},{"text":"and","start":9.62,"end":10.88},{"text":"energy","start":10.88,"end":11.34},{"text":"and","start":11.34,"end":12.36},{"text":"hope","start":12.36,"end":12.66,"punct":","},{"text":"who","start":13.5,"end":13.76},{"text":"can","start":13.76,"end":13.96},{"text":"claim","start":13.96,"end":14.4},{"text":"the","start":14.4,"end":14.64},{"text":"future","start":14.64,"end":15.0},{"text":"that","start":15.0,"end":15.2},{"text":"so","start":15.2,"end":15.5},{"text":"many","start":15.5,"end":15.76},{"text":"in","start":15.76,"end":16.1},{"tex